<para>
  Adjacent runs <emphasis role="strong">ab</emphasis> merge into one
  strong span.
</para>
<para>
  Doubled markers
  <emphasis role="strong"><emphasis role="strong">x</emphasis></emphasis>
  nest two strong spans.
</para>
<para>
  Doubled dashes
  <emphasis role="strikethrough"><emphasis role="strikethrough">x</emphasis></emphasis>
  nest two strikeout spans.
</para>
